OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA rather cloudy day with
OL,6,Fshowers, these most frequent in the
OL,7,Fwest. The best of the bright spells
OL,8,Fwill be towards the Moray Firth and
OL,9,FStrathspey.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FA rather cloudy evening but
OL,12,Fsome bright spells too. A few showers
OL,13,Fwill continue, perhaps merging to
OL,14,Flonger spells of rain over Skye and
OL,15,Fthe Uists later.
OL,16,
OL,17,CSunday:FA mostly cloudy day with
OL,18,Foutbreaks of rain. Best chance of dry
OL,19,Fand bright spells will be in the east.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
