OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:
OL,6,FFurther rain spreading east on Monday
OL,7,Fthen rain or showers on Tuesday and
OL,8,FWednesday. Staying quite cool for the
OL,9,Ftime of year.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
